			"date": "2019-05-24T12:43:20.000Z",
			"content": "<p>This test verifies that you accept a Webmention request that contains a valid source and target URL. To pass this test, your Webmention endpoint must return either HTTP 200, 201 or 202 along with the <a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/webmention/#receiving-webmentions\">appropriate headers</a>.</p>\n        <p>If your endpoint returns HTTP 201, then it MUST also return a <code>Location</code> header. If it returns HTTP 200 or 202, then it MUST NOT include a <code>Location</code> header.</p>",
			"type": "reply",
			"source": "https://webmention.rocks/receive/1/3b57bf67f97f07474c58ace89d4f2b67",
			"target": "https://www.zachleat.com/web/notes/webmention-test/",
			"via": "webmention"
		},
